  Post-1977: FY runs Oct (Y-1) to Sep (Y). FY1980 = Oct 1979 – Sep 1980.
  Calendar year = Jan 1 to Dec 31. CY ≠ FY.
  For calendar year totals: sum Jan–Dec monthly rows or find "Calendar yr." row.

MATH RULES:
